{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25024","headline":"七夕歌 · 刘言史","name":"七夕歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星寥寥兮月细轮，佳期可想兮不可亲。\n云衣香薄粧态新，彩軿悠悠度天津。\n玉幌相逢夜将极，妖红惨黛生愁色。\n寂寞低容入旧机，歇着金梭思往夕。\n人间不见因谁知，万家闺艳求此时。\n碧空露重彩盘湿，花上乞得蜘蛛丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘言史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}